      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i want to push the \"visceral\" part more though. i dont want them to just look tired, i want them to look fundamentally different from the High-Tiers on a more biological or inherent level. when the reader sees a crowd of Low-Tiers, what kind of specific ethnic or racialized features should i lean into to make them seem like a \"different\" kind of human compared to the elites? like, what kind of physical characteristics would make them look like they belong to a different lineage or group?",
